# Complexity

- **Time Complexity:** **O(M log M)**
  - Processing all emails and performing DSU operations: **O(M · α(N))**
  - Grouping emails: **O(M · α(N))**
  - Sorting all merged email lists: **O(M log M)**

- **Space Complexity:** **O(N + M)**
  - DSU arrays: **O(N)**
  - Email hashmap: **O(M)**
  - Merged email storage: **O(M)**

